$t = [System.IO.File]::ReadAllText($log, [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8)
$add = @'

FOLLOW-UP (__TS__): installers purged on request
-----------------------------------------------
The user asked not to keep the installer archive, so both staged packages were deleted:
  D:\program_runtime_environment\_downloads\deskreen   96.5 MB  removed
  D:\program_runtime_environment\_downloads\vdd        67.9 MB  removed
