     (gh-proxy.com measured 669 KB/s, ghfast.top 151 KB/s, ghproxy.net 45 KB/s)
  2) scripts\conv-20260928-3b54e160\download-file.js <url> <out> <bytes> --resume
  3) VDD: extract VDD.Control.<ver>.zip, then run install-vdd-driver.ps1 elevated (UAC)
  4) Deskreen: it is a PORTABLE build - running the .exe extracts to %TEMP%; copy that payload
     out to a permanent folder if you want to keep it
Note: the Python installer archive (D:\program_runtime_environment\_downloads\python, 31.7 MB)
was NOT touched - it is the repair/uninstall payload for the CPython install.
'@
