{"content": """"
Segmented puller for an arbitrary OpenVINO IR subfolder of the Qwen3-TTS repo.

Reuses the proven 8 MB segment + 4 concurrency + resume strategy from
pull-voice-design-segmented.py, but takes the subfolder as an argument so the same code can
fetch openvino_realtime/base (needed by voice_clone) or custom_voice.

